  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1473/598/mp_dark_rpg_header-c-webp.webp\" alt=\"DarkRPG 重製版\" width=\"2380\" height=\"874\"></p><p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1567/517/mp_dark_rpg_description-webp.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"2382\" height=\"236\"></strong></p><p>你的原版遊戲體驗將因以下功能而永遠改變：</p><ul>\n<li>我們廣受歡迎的 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/darkrpg\" rel=\"nofollow\">DarkRPG Fabric 模組包</a> 的重製版 (1.18.2)。</li>\n<li>應廣大玩家要求回歸！這是 DarkRPG Fabric 模組包的 1.18.2 版本，但已更新至當代標準。</li>\n<li>部分回歸的模組包括：FTB Quests（按 [i] 鍵）、FTB Teams、FTB Ranks、Mythic Mounts、Blockus、Adorn、Easy Magic、Enchanting Infuser、Architect's Palette、Simply Swords、MC Dungeon Armors/Weapons</li>\n<li>新增模組：所有 YUNG 結構模組、DarkRTP、DarkHeads、DarkInventory、DarkTides、Chidori Origins、可拾取村民與寵物、Tom's Storage，其餘模組均更新至最新 Fabric 標準</li>\n<li>針對低階電腦進行優化</li>\n<li>按 [i] 按鈕並使用左側選單欄完成任務</li>\n<li>捕捉並騎乘所有陸地與空中坐騎</li>\n<li>利用內建進度系統追蹤難以擊敗的生物</li>\n<li>收集所有盔甲與武器</li>\n<li>建造、施展魔法並盡情探索！<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br></span></li>\n</ul><p>在 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\">BisectHosting</a> 上遊玩 DarkRPG Fabric/Forge！一鍵即可開始線上遊玩。<br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\">BisectHosting</a> 是領先的 Minecraft 伺服器解決方案。立即與朋友一起遊玩 DarkRPG！<br>點擊下方橫幅或點擊<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a>並使用代碼 'gamerpotion' 即可享有 25% 折扣！</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1473/599/mp_dark_rpg_promo-webp.webp\" alt=\"獲取伺服器！\" width=\"2382\" height=\"353\"></a></span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1567/518/mp_dark_rpg_socials-webp.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"2382\" height=\"236\"></strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/uCPfPBvsRJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/418/join-discord.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"598\" height=\"187\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fgamerpotion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/419/kofi.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"604\" height=\"165\"></a></p>",
